        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc/models/2026-delphi10000-antirrhinum-majus-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L429-L494> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-antirrhinum-majus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
